## Branch Naming Rules

| Branch | Purpose | Automatic deploy |
|--------|---------|-----------------|
| `main` | Production | No (manual approval) |
| `develop` | Staging | Yes |
| `feature/*` | Feature branches | No |
| `hotfix/*` | Urgent fixes | No |
| `release/*` | Release candidates | Staging (manual) |

---

## Docker Image Versioning in CI

```
Pattern: {REGISTRY}/{OWNER}/{NAME}:{TAG}

Auto-generated tags:
  - sha-{short_sha}          → every push (immutable, traceability)
  - develop                  → push to develop (floating)
  - v{major}.{minor}.{patch} → semantic tag (git tag push)
  - v{major}.{minor}         → floating minor
  - latest                   → ONLY on develop; NEVER on main/production
```

**Production image NEVER uses `latest`** — always SHA256 digest or fixed semantic tag.

